Simple Icons (CC0 1.0 Universal)
https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons

Canonical CDN listed by the Toolbox spec (cdn.simpleicons.org). The same
SVG markup is vendored here so the GUI never hotlinks at runtime:
  vlc.svg                 <- cdn.simpleicons.org/vlcmediaplayer
  lutris.svg              <- cdn.simpleicons.org/lutris
  heroic.svg              <- cdn.simpleicons.org/heroicgameslauncher
  obs-studio.svg          <- cdn.simpleicons.org/obsstudio
  mpv.svg                 <- cdn.simpleicons.org/mpv
  htop.svg                <- cdn.simpleicons.org/htop
  pycharm-community.svg   <- cdn.simpleicons.org/pycharm

brave-origin.svg is Chris's lion artwork for Brave Origin. It is not a
dashboard-icons or Simple Icons asset and must not be replaced with the
orange Brave Browser mark.
